# Portfolio core

- Read [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) and [docs/adr/](docs/adr/README.md) before non-trivial work.
- Canonical product: `src/containers/portfolio` on `/` and `/portfolio`.
- Static GitHub Pages deploy — no server-only Next features for core pages.
- Content lives in locale packs (`locale-resume`, `locale-ui`) — keep EN/ID/JP aligned.
- Prefer editing `src/app/page.tsx` path via containers, not inventing parallel home UIs.
